{"strongs": "H3889", "word": "לושׁ", "translit": "lush", "root": "לוש", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Laish", "definition": "לושׁ ( Kt ) proper name, masculine , לַ֫יִשׁ see לישׁ . לָז , לָזֶה , לֵזוּ see הַלָּז etc. לְזוּת see לוז above. לַח see below לחח .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4383')\">BDB4383</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3889')\">H3889</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H3919')\">H3919</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4382')\">BDB4382</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4384')\">BDB4384</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>לושׁ</bdbheb> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup>) <b>proper name, masculine</b>, <bdbheb>לַ֫יִשׁ</bdbheb> <b>see</b> <bdbheb>לישׁ</bdbheb>. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>לָז</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לָזֶה</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>לֵזוּ</bdbheb> see  <bdbheb><reflink>הַלָּז</reflink></bdbheb> etc.</p><hr><p><bdbheb>לְזוּת</bdbheb> <b>see</b> <bdbheb>לוז</bdbheb> above. </p><hr><p><bdbheb>לַח</bdbheb> <b>see</b> below <bdbheb>לחח</bdbheb>. </p><hr>", "references": [], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["לושׁ", "לַ֫יִשׁ", "לישׁ", "לָז", "לָזֶה", "לֵזוּ", "הַלָּז", "לְזוּת", "לוז", "לַח", "לחח"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Kt"]}, "covers": ["H3889", "H3919"], "bdbid": "BDB4383", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}